# Ask vs Fix (tech@ Cloud)

When this clone is used by Cursor Cloud / assign-to-Juno:

- **Ask** (how-to, where-is, timezone, can Growi tell, policy): comment a customer-ready answer + file proof on Linear. No PR.
- **Fix** (bug, missing feature, change settings): PR + Linear QA proof + ping Solomon. Merge only after he approves on Slack or GitHub. He deploys.
- Ben send gate is separate: how-to / where-is / timezone, ≥80%, not money/legal/churn/angry. Never send as Solomon.
- Never mutate production. Never query another org than the ticket.
- Follow `.cursor/skills/linear-issue-workflow/SKILL.md`.
